  "id": "chronic-illness",
  "term": "chronic illness",
  "definition": "Chronic illness is a medical condition that continues for a long time, is expected to last more than three months, or comes back repeatedly, such as more than three times in a year. In adolescents, chronic illness can be linked with ongoing stress and a higher risk of mental health difficulties, although many still adapt well psychologically.",
